From: TeamHarrisCali <34009957+TeamHarrisCali@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 05:13:07 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] DS desktop: cheaper page flips (async flip, copy only the
 drawn area found by wrapping the screen draw functions), hardware sprite
 pointer (OBJ in VRAM bank F), Start menu: Exit desktop and a real Shut down
 (/boot/shutdown = sync; poweroff)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
